// enrichment D-5: pacing is contract conformance). lastSend is keyed by
// plugin id, so plugins pace independently; the next slot is RESERVED under
// the mutex before any wait, so concurrent workers for one plugin serialize
// at the interval instead of bursting together. The clock is injectable
// (tests); process wiring constructs the production gate with the real clock
// (NewFetchGate) and injects it via Deps.FetchGate — never a package var.
